red scaffold.\n\n## Protected material / consumers\nExcluded as already minimal: test_fixture_heal_heldout.py#C:<module>:before:test_empty_usage_rows_still_fail_closed_on_budget:separator (6w). Preserve all other prose, inline comments, runtime strings, regexes, prompts, assertions, data, and executable AST. The 25 directive lines retain exact text and inline/next-code attachment; shebang count is 0. No selected docstring has a runtime documentation consumer. Pytest collects all 18 modules; comment hygiene scans them.\n\n## Independent receipt\nA non-author posts exactly 38 leaf-linked TSV rows:\n`stable_id<TAB>full_before_SHA:path#ID<TAB>full_final_SHA:path#ID<TAB>contract_or_consumer<TAB>before_words<TAB>after_words<TAB>directives_exact<TAB>semantic_preservation<TAB>bloat_removal<TAB>reviewer_session`.\nEach has `after_words < before_words` and PASS in all 3 verdict columns. Missing/duplicate/extra, author-reviewed, short-SHA, or non-PASS rows block closure.\n\n## Acceptance\n- [ ] Exactly 38 allowlisted blocks are shorter and retain each path's contracts.\n- [ ] Parent/final parse with `ast.parse(..., type_comments=True)`; remove only allowed leading docstrings, normalize only `ast.TypeIgnore.lineno`, and require exact attribute-free AST dumps.\n- [ ] Immutable target text equals the leaf parent; protected prose/directives/shebangs match; zero-context hunks stay inside resolved immutable spans/adjacent blanks.\n- [ ] `HEAD^..HEAD` equals all 18 impacts; focused pytest, scoped Ruff check/format, hygiene, diff check, and untimed worktree-venv `make verify` pass.\n- [ ] Exactly 38 fully cited independent PASS rows exist.\n\n## Verification\nRun all 7 persisted DD commands: immutable-prose-only, exact-leaf-paths, focused-tests, scoped-ruff, comment-hygiene, diff-integrity, repository-gates."}},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"EDIT","timestamp":1788632897958328100,"uuid":"a5a4832e-8a29-49b5-b894-20f3d9cc7bce"}